 "text": "Hi, how are you doing right now? That's a bit of stuck rut. Have you tried immersing short lessons weekly while still trying to practice? It does increase motivation a bit, especially if you do it as a coffee break pair pair. Not as much as you' surprised. Full lessons are about half an hour, and most people find they can squeeze it in. You can, it helps you really hear what you' doing wrong and get feedback. Good. Offers lessons if you get stuck. Many people never push through the basic cachet.",
